			"notes": "## What's New\n* Target 1.19.1\n* Updated to Carpet's new settings system\n  * Mod now requires at least [Carpet v1.4.80](https://github.com/gnembon/fabric-carpet/releases/tag/1.4.80) due to it referencing new settings classes that don't exist in prior versions.\n\nDue to the Carpet's changes to their settings, the carpet rules for this mod now use language files. Feel free to open a PR with any language you wish to be supported.\n\n\n**See all changes**: https://github.com/totorewa/totos-carpet-tweaks/compare/0.2.5...0.3.0"
