			"notes": "What's changed:\n\n* Fixed #4 - When players join the server, if they spawn in survival and have a survival position saved against their player, they will be teleported to their survival position after connecting. Survival position is cleared after player is returned to it so the return is not unintentionally replayed. \n\nChanges have been backported to the 1.16.4 version of this mod."
